Z||000000||Oreif||06-04-2001||03:26 PM||||Due to the high popularity of the emblems (door tabs) That I paint and the limited supply I have of them, I am offering a <B> <I>"June Special"</I> </B> Anyone who sends me <B>two or more sets</B> of emblems gets a <B>FREE</B> set painted in the style/colors of their choice. If you already have a set of my emblems but can still scrape up a few sets, I'll pay for shipping + $1.00 per emblem ($2.00 per set)<P>I can be Emailed at: se1986@home.com<P>Here are some sample color choices. I can do any color you'd like.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Emblem_01_1.jpg">  <P>Thanks,<BR><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||4
